output "db_security_group_id" {
  value = aws_security_group.orders_db.id
}
terraform {
  required_version = ">= 1.11.0"

  required_providers {
    aws = {
      source  = "hashicorp/aws"
      version = "~> 6.0"
    }
  }

  backend "s3" {
    bucket       = "orders-terraform-state"
    key          = "orders/terraform.tfstate"
    region       = "eu-north-1"
    encrypt      = true
    use_lockfile = true
  }
}
provider "aws" {
  region = "eu-north-1"
}
# orders

Terraform for the orders service's data tier. The security group and subnet group are in place;
the database itself is not yet.

The deploy job reads this configuration's outputs with `terraform output -json`.

